    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so like, if i'm looking at a meal plan, what are some specific examples of high GI carbs vs low GI carbs? also how much of a difference does it actually make for someone trying to keep their levels stable?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
